Package: cloudflare-ddns
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39)
Maintainer: Hector Friedman-Cintron hector.friedman.cintron@gmail.com
Description: Cloudflare Dynamic DNS updater
 Lightweight Rust-based Dynamic DNS client that monitors
 public IPv4 changes and updates a configured Cloudflare
 DNS A record automatically.
